# Build output and tool logs — add this stack's directories here.
# Tool logs print absolute paths (your username, your directory layout);
# ignore them, or scrub them before committing one as evidence.
build/
dist/
*.log

# Environment files — never commit real values.
# .env.*.example IS committed (it carries no secrets); nothing else is.
.env
.env.*
!.env.*.example

# serena MCP (optional, opt-in) — local symbol cache + project config.
# Machine-specific; regenerated on first run. See docs/serena-setup.md.
.serena/

# Claude Code local-only files — personal settings and notes that must
# not propagate to other machines or contributors. The shared
# counterparts (.claude/settings.json, CLAUDE.md, .claude/agents/,
# .claude/skills/, .claude/commands/) ARE committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# Local delegation state — /delegate packets and runner scratch data.
# Per-run and machine-specific; never committed.
.agentic/delegate/

# Pi project packages — Pi installs the packages named in .pi/settings.json
# (pi-subagents) here on first start and writes a .gitignore inside that
# un-ignores itself. Ignore the whole directory so a fresh checkout or a
# handoff worktree stays clean after Pi runs.
.pi/npm/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
